Attention, my dear friends! Attention! Alarm!

This is not a drill! With great pleasure and unconcealed trembling the After Shadows' team informs you: the game demo version is available!

Go to our Steam page right now, download the demo and enjoy it. And when you finish, don't forget to add us to your wishlist.

What is important to understand about the demo:
- it's about one quarter of the whole game;
- the demo version doesn't support the controller (joystick), only the keyboard;
- the game is still in the design, so be merciful if you meet a bug.
At the same time, with the help of the demo, you will be able to:
- try all the mechanics;
- enjoy the elegant art, intricate sounds and hypnotic music;
- help the development -- your feedback or an indication of a bug will be very useful to us.

So, once again:
    1. download the demo;
    2. play;
    3. enjoy;
    4. add the game to your wishlist;
    5. write a review;
    6. wait for the release of the full version!
